# Local verify before commit / push

- Run `pnpm verify` and keep it green **before every commit and every push**.
- Never push a tip that fails prettier, lint, typecheck, unit/property/golden tests, boundaries, secrets, or licenses.
- When the change touches `supabase/migrations/**` or `supabase/seed.sql`, also run Supabase DB tests (`pnpm env:up` → `pnpm db:reset` → DB test log / `pnpm test:coverage:db` as applicable) and keep them green before push.
- Pre-push is enforced by lefthook (`lefthook.yml` → `pnpm verify`). Do not bypass with `--no-verify` unless Carlos explicitly authorizes an emergency.
- Prefer fixing locally over relying on GitHub Actions to catch the same failure.
